ack","text":"an earlier draft treated the year report as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline#9","page":"projects/ledgerline","lead":"Honest weekly CSV limits","text":"Sam chose to keep the weekly CSV and the duplicate guard distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/ledgerline/pull/34"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline#10","page":"projects/ledgerline","lead":"Rollback bundle before audit note","text":"rollback bundle changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check per statement is bounded evidence, not proof that the audit note works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://example-store.test/listing-guide"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline#11","page":"projects/ledgerline","lead":"One tracking entry, two surfaces","text":"the tracking entry classifies per statement and surfaces a plain warning when the duplicate guard is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/ledgerline-email-receipts"],"cites":["https://example-store.test/listing-guide"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline#12","page":"projects/ledgerline","lead":"One rollback bundle, two surfaces","text":"Sam chose to keep the rollback bundle and the register row distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/95e42275-7df0-9a0b-7cbf-7c73cb018066","https://example-store.test/listing-guide"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline#13","page":"projects/ledgerline","lead":"Register row survives rollback","text":"Sam chose to keep the register row and the year report distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the s